      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25e-perchlike-fishes-5-remaining-cichlids-from-south-and-central-america/crenicichla_zebrina_en-2/",
      "html": "<p>So far no external features are known for this species to separate males from females. However, one of the imported specimens is much more slender, has a much larger humeral spot and a comparatively deeper red coloured throat. It is thought that this specimen is a male and the other one a female.</p>"
    },
